{"id":"v6","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":10,"of":15,"title":"The two passives","titleHe":"פֻּעַל וְהֻפְעַל","goal":"Recognise pu'al and huf'al on the page.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"Two binyanim exist only as passives: פֻּעַל is the passive of pi'el, הֻפְעַל the passive of hif'il. Neither has an infinitive or an imperative, and outside the third person they're rare — so this is a recognition lesson, not a production one."},{"type":"passives","items":[{"id":"pual","he":"פֻּעַל","en":"pu'al","of":"piel","note":"The passive of pi'el — something is being done to the subject.","verb":{"root":"ד־ב־ר","en":"to be spoken (of)"},"present":{"ms":"מְדֻבָּר","fs":"מְדֻבֶּרֶת","mp":"מְדֻבָּרִים","fp":"מְדֻבָּרוֹת"},"past":{"3ms":"דֻּבַּר","3fs":"דֻּבְּרָה","3p":"דֻּבְּרוּ"},"future":{"3ms":"יְדֻבַּר","3fs":"תְּדֻבַּר","3p":"יְדֻבְּרוּ"}},{"id":"hufal","he":"הֻפְעַל","en":"huf'al","of":"hifil","note":"The passive of hif'il.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","en":"to be explained"},"present":{"ms":"מֻסְבָּר","fs":"מֻסְבֶּרֶת","mp":"מֻסְבָּרִים","fp":"מֻסְבָּרוֹת"},"past":{"3ms":"הֻסְבַּר","3fs":"הֻסְבְּרָה","3p":"הֻסְבְּרוּ"},"future":{"3ms":"יֻסְבַּר","3fs":"תֻּסְבַּר","3p":"יֻסְבְּרוּ"}}]},{"type":"tip","body":"Look for the u vowel where you'd expect a or i. מְדַבֵּר speaks becomes מְדֻבָּר is spoken of; מַסְבִּיר explains becomes מֻסְבָּר is explained."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מְדֻבָּר","en":"spoken of, in question","translit":"meduba r"},{"he":"מֻסְבָּר","en":"explained","translit":"musbar"},{"he":"מְקֻבָּל","en":"accepted, customary","translit":"mekubal"},{"he":"מֻכָּן","en":"ready, prepared","translit":"muchan"},{"he":"מְסֻדָּר","en":"arranged, tidy","translit":"mesudar"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["then","spoken of, in question","flame, blade","bridge"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מְדֻבָּר","translit":"meduba r"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["explained","forty","feels","finds"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מֻסְבָּר","translit":"musbar"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["inheritance, estate","mouse","accepted, customary","meal"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מְקֻבָּל","translit":"mekubal"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["happy new year","bridge","ready, prepared","dirty"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מֻכָּן","translit":"muchan"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["arranged, tidy","blue (f.)","football","helps"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מְסֻדָּר","translit":"mesudar"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “ready, prepared”?","options":["לוּלָב","מֻכָּן","הַתְחָלָה","בְּדֶרֶךְ כְּלָל"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “arranged, tidy”?","options":["מִזְבֵּחַ","יָפֶה","מְסֻדָּר","אֹרֶךְ"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מְדֻבָּר","spoken of, in question"],["מֻסְבָּר","explained"],["מְקֻבָּל","accepted, customary"],["מֻכָּן","ready, prepared"],["מְסֻדָּר","arranged, tidy"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “accepted, customary”?","options":["אַף פַּעַם","אַף כִּי","מְקֻבָּל","יוֹתֵר"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “explained”?","options":["מְחַפֵּשׂ","מֻסְבָּר","בָּהִיר","אֶלָּא"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"מְסֻדָּר","translit":"mesudar","en":"arranged, tidy"},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["מְסֻדָּר","מְקֻבָּל","מֻכָּן","מְדֻבָּר"],"correct":2,"say":"מֻכָּן","he":true},{"type":"type","q":"Write “spoken of, in question” in Hebrew","answer":"מְדֻבָּר","hint":"meduba r"}]}